+  /**
+   * Universal audio file decoder. Detects whether the file is a raw WAV (RIFF
+   * header) and falls back to Android's MediaExtractor + MediaCodec pipeline
+   * for compressed formats (M4A/AAC, MP3, OGG, etc.). Output is always 16 kHz
+   * mono float samples in [-1, 1] — exactly what whisper.cpp expects.
